# Documentation Cleanup Plan
> Date: 2026-04-02
> Status: Pending execution

---

## 1. Problem Diagnosis

The current documentation has the following issues:

| Problem | Details |
|---------|---------|
| **Documents too long** | `cache_system_architecture.md` (English, 1436 lines) and `cache_system_architecture_chinese.md` (Chinese, 1450 lines) are both overly verbose and need trimming |
| **Misplaced files** | `exp/qdrant_exp.md` (768 lines) and `exp/toy_server.log` (812 lines) are design documents and should not be in the experiment code directory |
| **Redundant content** | Core patterns in `toy_server.log` are already covered by `step3_data_collection.log`; `faiss_uv_toolchain_plan.md` (785 lines) is overly verbose |
| **Unclear responsibilities** | `docs/` mixes architecture design docs with usage guides; `logs/` step3.log (165 lines) content is superseded by step1.log and step3_data_collection.log |
| **Outdated index** | `docs/md_log_index.md` is too verbose (107 lines) and will need rewriting after reorganization |

---

## 2. Cleanup Principles

- **`docs/`**: Project-level architecture + usage guides. Targeted at "people wanting to understand or use the project"
- **`logs/`**: Detailed plans and code change records from implementation phases. Targeted at "agents and developers working on the code"
- **`exp/`**: Only experiment scripts and configs, no design documents
- **Language strategy**: Project documentation is primarily in English. Existing Chinese documents are kept (not deleted); Chinese and English versions are maintained in sync (e.g., both versions of cache_system_architecture coexist)
- Delete purely duplicated content; trim verbose documents

